                                                "sense_id": "8355823d-8963-36af-bbd3-5f979e2a35f4",
                                                "text": "`Will you undertake the task? We give you complete freedom, and as a reward you will, we believe, have the credit of presenting to the world the most wonderful history, as distinguished from romance, that its records can show.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b90a5e32-010c-3ab2-bb59-7b4eaaa36093",
                                        "entry_id": "83b075f6-18c2-3969-99f8-234f9426bde3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tale of high adventure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d16e595-10c6-4a5f-8f00-3ccb7a58750f",
                                                "sense_id": "b90a5e32-010c-3ab2-bb59-7b4eaaa36093",
                                                "text": "Could one have known the past histories of some of the oddly-selected couples who shared everything in common, many a romance might have been written during what, to all outward appearances, was a dull and prosaic time to most lookers-on!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01194cfa-3e10-3ab8-8ff9-7f569233719c",
                                        "entry_id": "83b075f6-18c2-3969-99f8-234f9426bde3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mysterious, exciting, or fascinating quality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "852536f6-55d1-3180-9592-b7749dc8703e",
                                        "entry_id": "83b075f6-18c2-3969-99f8-234f9426bde3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A literary or filmic genre about idealized love."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5dca5b51-4862-330b-b83c-5d5a6d5e4c93",
                                        "entry_id": "83b075f6-18c2-3969-99f8-234f9426bde3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An embellished account of something; an idealized lie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10fae715-802f-329e-b3d8-b89131eaa855",
                                        "entry_id": "83b075f6-18c2-3969-99f8-234f9426bde3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An adventure, or series of extraordinary events, resembling those narrated in romances."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc7e75d3-7a6d-44bb-bc47-df6c61cb43f3",
                                                "sense_id": "10fae715-802f-329e-b3d8-b89131eaa855",
                                                "text": "His life was a romance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ebdfee2-ef01-38f0-8878-1d1a27bb7a3c",
                                        "entry_id": "83b075f6-18c2-3969-99f8-234f9426bde3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dreamy, imaginative habit of mind; a disposition to ignore what is real."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00570289-3f41-406e-89d7-3e0a1211dbbd",
                                                "sense_id": "1ebdfee2-ef01-38f0-8878-1d1a27bb7a3c",
                                                "text": "She was so full of romance she would forget what she was supposed to be doing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a5e9152-f231-3011-b734-67b3b117c5fb",
                                        "entry_id": "83b075f6-18c2-3969-99f8-234f9426bde3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sentimental piece of music; a romanza."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "romance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ee19a28-67f4-331b-9bf7-43fcda9f63a9",
                                        "entry_id": "1f5b668c-fa02-3c12-9b35-eb027269ad2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To woo; to court."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d39fb9fc-a531-41a8-a091-287b9b20bbc0",
                                                "sense_id": "2ee19a28-67f4-331b-9bf7-43fcda9f63a9",
                                                "text": "A female Shepard can romance bisexual Yeoman Kelly Chambers, but doing so does not yield a Paramour achievement or an implied sex scene the way that romancing ‘official’ interests does. Similarly, the player can attempt to romance the Asari Samara or her Ardat-Yakshi daughter Morinth, but the former will refuse and sex with the latter will kill Shepard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "689e2379-b3bf-4456-b483-8183a5938d8c",
                                                "sense_id": "2ee19a28-67f4-331b-9bf7-43fcda9f63a9",
                                                "text": "In the ghetto, the gentle Barber romances a defiant washerwoman, Hannah, who is played by Chaplin's wife at the time, Paulette Goddard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aec4ec6b-3d97-32a1-9b0b-cf0524227756",
                                        "entry_id": "1f5b668c-fa02-3c12-9b35-eb027269ad2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To write or tell romantic stories, poetry, letters, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af94a955-42c2-3c12-8f8e-8b39c7c5bb7c",
                                        "entry_id": "1f5b668c-fa02-3c12-9b35-eb027269ad2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To talk extravagantly and imaginatively; to build castles in the air."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
